  "decisive_read_conclusions": [
    "10MiB FORCE_CONTIGUOUS generic allocation requires order12; existing config CMA=n and default MAX_ORDER10 do not provide this route. Independent order9 2MiB extents remain legal.",
    "2MiB leaf requires both PA and IOVA alignment plus full owned extent; SG mapping success alone is insufficient.",
    "Production mode0 buffer depth3 differs from stage106 private depth512. Mode1 can provide first-two depth512 with runtime NB off, but no live board image is inferred.",
    "vLLM stable pools and logical refcount/free are distinct from IOMMU unmap; existing layer event/order provides release/use safety.",
    "Conservative free-slot heuristics and optional recomputation mean source swap alone does not prove unavoidable physical-capacity pressure.",
    "Current copy mapping is available before issue; CUDA stream is not a physical DID. No actual mapping cost or uncovered translation-related performance gap is measured."
  ],
